  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Any general point on the line <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is</p><p><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />This must satisfy the given&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msup></math> line</p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />So, the point of intersection of the two lines are <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Equation of the required plane is</p><p><math><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
